= Carl Schurz

Carl Schurz is one of the nation's most prominent German Americans. A veteran of the European revolutions, Union general, journalist, and statesman, Schurz has long championed civil service reform, honest government, and the rights of immigrants. As a leading <span style="color: #DAA520;">**Liberal Republican**</span>, he believes the nation can only prosper through capable administration and equal opportunity.

